    "note": "AA is evaluated as a black-box off/on contrast. AA-OFF runs only when the harness's native human-confirmation event can be observed and reliably answered by the host bridge; RQ2_REVIEWER_MODEL must differ from the acting model. AA-ON uses each harness's existing native switch. Reviewer code, context, and credentials remain outside the agent/task container. Internal authorization algorithms are neither classified nor inferred."
